 "image": "engenn5le03ob06re2img02.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Colette</span>: Let's talk about workplace safety. Injuries such as burns and scalds are common in restaurants. It's important to take precautions when working especially with the deep fryer. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I read that many burns are a result of those. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Colette</span>: Actually, when I started working in the restaurant industry, I had a small accident. <br>", "id": 1, "time": "2", "image": "engenn5le03ob06re2img02.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: What happened?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Colette</span>: You'll notice the area in front of a fryer gets lots of grease around it. I had a slip and fall accident. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Did you hurt yourself badly?", "id": 2, "time": "19000", "image": "engenn5le03ob06re2img09.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Colette</span>: No, I didn't. Remember to be careful. Any other questions?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: How do you avoid getting any scalds? There's lots of hot liquids in the kitchen.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Colette</span>: Of course. Just follow all safety procedures when cooking with hot liquids. Read through the manual.", "id": 3, "time": "29000", "image": "engenn5le03ob06re2img08.jpg"}]}}]}]}], "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Vanessa's Stories"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "What Happened?"}, {"type": "position", "content": 6}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 3}, {"type": "level", "content": "A2.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Describe characteristics of different people and their jobs."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn5le03ob06re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Talking about Injuries"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "Burns are common injuries. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Burns are injuries to the body's tissues (material that is made up of cells) caused by heat.  "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Scalds are a type of burn.  "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Burns are grouped according to how much the tissue is damaged."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Type of Burn\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"What Happens?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"first degree burn\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><ul><li>redness </li><li>swelling in top layer of skin</li></ul></span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"second degree burn\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><ul><li>redness </li><li>swelling </li><li>blistering of skin</li></ul></span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"third degree burn\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><ul><li>damage of all layers of skin </li><li>scarring</li></ul></span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Quantifiers "}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use quantifiers to talk about the quantity or amount of something.<br><br>  A quantifier can be general or specific. A general quantifier talks about that thing in a general way. A specific quantifier has more information. It refers to a specific example of that thing."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"General Quantifiers\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Specific Quantifiers\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Count Nouns\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"All<br> Most<br> Many<br> Some<br> Any<br> A few<br> A lot of<br> A couple of<br> No\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"All of <br> Most of<br> Many of<br> Some of<br> Any of<br> A few of<br> A lot of (the ... )<br> A couple of (the ... )<br> None of\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Non-Count Nouns\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"All<br> Some <br>Any<br> A little <br>Much<br> No\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"All of<br> Some of<br> Any of<br> A little<br> Much of\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">Most equipment help prevent accidents. (Non-Count - general) </span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">All of the oil in the deep fryers is checked.  (Non-Count - specific) </span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">Many burns are a result of deep fryer accidents.  (Count - general) </span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">Some of these accidents result in serious injuries. (Count - specific)</span>"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "workplace safety "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "protecting the health of people at work  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Workplace safety is an important topic in the office. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le03ob06aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use to talk about an accident. "}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "injury "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a wound or damage to part of your body "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": " Example: Injuries are common in restaurants. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le03ob06aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "burn "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "an injury caused by fire "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Burns are heat related injuries."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le03ob06aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "scald "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a burn on your skin caused by hot liquid or steam "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: How do you avoid getting a scalded?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le03ob06aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "precaution"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "something you do to prevent something dangerous from happening "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: It's important to take precautions."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le03ob06aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "deep fryer"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "an appliance that cooks food in hot oil "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Be careful when you use the deep fryer.  "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le03ob06aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "grease "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "an oily substance that comes off food made using butter or oil "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Don't slip on the grease on the floor."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le03ob06aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "slip and fall "}, {"type": "definition", "content": " losing your balance and dropping down  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I had a slip and fall accident."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le03ob06aud08"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "badly "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to a serious level  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adverb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Did you hurt yourself badly?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le03ob06aud09"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "safety procedure "}, {"type": "definition", "content": " a series of actions that are followed in order to be safe"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": " Example: Just follow all safety procedures when cooking with hot liquids.  "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le03ob06aud10"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Go on the internet. Search common injuries in the workplace."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Choose one (not burns or scalds)."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write 7-8 sentences about this injury. Answer these questions: <ul><li>How does it happen?</li> <li>What can you do to avoid it?</li></ul>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read your sentences aloud to a partner."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I talk about work."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I research a common injury."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I read my sentences aloud. "}]}], "type": "sena"}